   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Governance & Data Lineage:** Records from 2026-01 onward are synthetic refresh batches made by our oversampling step. Step changes in early 2026 come from that generator, not from business performance.  \n**Metric Contracts (hover `(i)` on panels for details):** **Net sales**: Gross sales minus discount | Grain: USD; one row per sales transaction, summed | Target: None set | Exclusions: Rows with null IDs or price <= 0 are rejected at staging | **Gross margin %**: (Net sales - cost of goods sold) / net sales x 100 | Grain: Percent; per channel group and month | Target: >= 21% (assumed) | Exclusions: Unmatched channel keys would show as Unknown (none found) | **Channel group**: E-commerce if SalesChannel contains 'commerce'; Hospital if PharmacyType contains 'hospital'; otherwise Retail | Grain: Label derived from Dim_Channel | Target: n/a | Exclusions: n/a | **Change vs previous refresh**: Value after the latest BI refresh minus value after the refresh before it | Grain: Same unit as the KPI | Target: n/a | Exclusions: First refresh has no previous value"
   }
  }
